{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUMPLing</strong> is a fast-paced top-down survival shooter with a metroidvania twist, blending chaotic action with strange storytelling. You play as the Overseer, pulled into the bizarre land of <strong>DUMPL</strong>, where everything fights back and shadows watch your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between perspectives as you explore and fight:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platformer exploration</strong>: Navigate winding tunnels and vertical caves in classic 2D side-scrolling style, uncovering secrets and hidden paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down survival combat</strong>:\u00a0Face relentless waves of dumpling-like enemies in chaotic arenas where reflexes and strategy are key.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083090?t=1760188226","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083090?t=1760188226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083090/d99214afa5f284fccfd2a165042d3e7b6bbfda61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760188226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083090/d99214afa5f284fccfd2a165042d3e7b6bbfda61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760188226","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUMPLing</strong> is a fast-paced top-down survival shooter with a metroidvania twist, blending chaotic action with strange storytelling. You play as the Overseer, pulled into the bizarre land of <strong>DUMPL</strong>, where everything fights back and shadows watch your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between perspectives as you explore and fight:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragra